              "value": "what are the complete details of each financing programs (Virtual Card, Dynamic Discounting and Supply Chain Financing) ?"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"AnswerWithCitations\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"value\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"The answer text.\"\n    },\n    \"citations\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"description\": \"List of citations relevant to the answer.\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"citedText\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The cited text.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"citedText\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"value\",\n    \"citations\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "RAG_DOCUMENT_TOOL"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "RAG Output Processing Agent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769413666759"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_RAG_OUTPUT_PROCESSING_AGENT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774435247635",
          "id": "1769414129623",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769414129625_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert data transformation API. Your task is to read the provided output from a RAG system and transform it strictly into the target API payload format. \n\nRAG Output - {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_RAG_DOCUMENT_TOOL_FINANCING_PROGRAMS_RAG.$output.value}} \n\n### Execution Sequence (MANDATORY)\nYou must process the text using this strict sequence to prevent data loss:\n1. Identify a financing program and map its Type, Name, and Code.\n2. Map its top-level numerical attributes (Rates, Dates).\n3. CRITICAL HALT: If the program is a VIRTUAL_CREDIT_CARD, you are strictly forbidden from moving to the next program until you have scanned the text immediately following it for \"RCN\" blocks and fully populated the `instruments` array.\n\n### General Mapping Rules \n1. Wrap the output in a single root object containing the array \"ragDocument\". \n2. Drop all boolean availability flags and descriptive text fields. Do not generate backend database IDs. \n3. LINE BREAK GUARDRAIL: The text contains erratic line breaks mid-value (e.g., \"Net \\n 30\"). You MUST read across these line breaks to extract the full logical value.\n4. CASE PRESERVATION: Preserve the exact text casing for all extracted strings exactly as they appear in the source.\n\n### Type-Specific Rules \n\n1. For Supply Chain Financing: \n* Set \"financingProgramType\": \"SUPPLY_CHAIN_FINANCING\". \n* Map the borrowing rate to \"marketBorrowingInterestRate\". \n* Extract the FIRST integer from the payment terms text and map to \"extendedPaymentDate\". \n\n2. For Dynamic Discounting: \n* Set \"financingProgramType\": \"DYNAMIC_DISCOUNTING\". \n* Map the investment rate to \"marketShortTermInvestmentInterestRate\". \n* Map the default APR to \"defaultAPR\", minimum APR to \"minAPR\", maximum APR to \"maxAPR\". \n\n3. For Virtual Cards (ZERO TOLERANCE FOR DROPPED INSTRUMENTS): \n* Set \"financingProgramType\": \"VIRTUAL_CREDIT_CARD\". \n* Map the \"Market Short Term Borrowing Rate (%)\" to \"marketBorrowingInterestRate\". \n* INSTRUMENT ARRAY ENFORCEMENT: A VIRTUAL_CREDIT_CARD object without an \"instruments\" array is an invalid output. Scan the text for repeating numbered blocks (e.g., \"RCN #1\", \"RCN #2\"). For EVERY numbered block found under this program, generate a new object inside the \"instruments\" array.\n* Inside each object in the \"instruments\" array, apply these exact mappings: \n  * instrumentName: Find the anchor \"Alias Name:\". Extract ONLY the exact value that immediately follows it. Do not include any preceding labels, prefixes, or the anchor itself. Example: Given \"RCN #2 Alias Name: CORP-VC2-USD\", output \"CORP-VC2-USD\".\n  * rebateRate: Extract the numeric float value following \"Rebate Rate (%)\".\n  * billingCycle: If \"Billing Date\" is present: Extract the integer day (e.g., from \"15th\", extract 15) to \"billingCycleDayNumber\", and map the frequency appropriately (e.g., if it says \"each month\", set \"billingCycleFrequency\": \"ORA_MONTHLY\"). \n  * gracePeriod: If \"Payment Terms\" or \"Grace Period\" is present: Extract the integer days (e.g., from \"Net 30\", extract 30) to \"gracePeriod\".\n\n### Target JSON Schema Definition\nYour output must strictly validate against the following JSON schema. Do not include markdown formatting like ```json in your response; output raw JSON only.\n\n{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"ragDocument\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"financingProgramType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"SUPPLY_CHAIN_FINANCING\",\n              \"DYNAMIC_DISCOUNTING\",\n              \"VIRTUAL_CREDIT_CARD\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"financingProgramName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"financingProgramCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"marketBorrowingInterestRate\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"marketShortTermInvestmentInterestRate\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"defaultAPR\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"minAPR\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"maxAPR\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"extendedPaymentDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          },\n          \"instruments\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"instrumentName\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"billingCycleFrequency\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"billingCycleDayNumber\": {\n                  \"type\": \"integer\"\n                },\n                \"gracePeriod\": {\n                  \"type\": \"integer\"\n                },\n                \"rebateRate\": {\n                  \"type\": \"number\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"instrumentName\",\n                \"rebateRate\"\n              ],\n              \"additionalProperties\": false\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"financingProgramType\",\n          \"financingProgramName\",\n          \"financingProgramCode\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"ragDocument\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"ragDocument\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"financingProgramType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"SUPPLY_CHAIN_FINANCING\",\n              \"DYNAMIC_DISCOUNTING\",\n              \"VIRTUAL_CREDIT_CARD\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"financingProgramName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"financingProgramCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"marketBorrowingInterestRate\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"marketShortTermInvestmentInterestRate\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"defaultAPR\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"minAPR\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"maxAPR\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"extendedPaymentDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n          },\n          \"instruments\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"instrumentName\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\"\n                },\n                \"billingCycleFrequency\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"enum\": [\n                    \"ORA_MONTHLY\"\n                  ]\n                },\n                \"billingCycleDayNumber\": {\n                  \"type\": \"integer\"\n                },\n                \"gracePeriod\": {\n                  \"type\": \"integer\"\n                },\n                \"rebateRate\": {\n                  \"type\": \"number\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"required\": [\n                \"instrumentName\",\n                \"rebateRate\"\n              ],\n              \"additionalProperties\": false\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"financingProgramType\",\n          \"financingProgramName\",\n          \"financingProgramCode\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"ragDocument\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
